      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "4 ANCHOR PLANTED",
      "narration_text": "Here's what a skill actually is: one file. Gaps, for instance, is a folder holding a single SKILL.md — instructions for opening a tracker, reporting what's flagged and not yet closed, and updating an item when you close it or risk-accept it.",
