      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "5 both directions",
      "narration_text": "Watching Claude close out a gap cleanly doesn't prove it understood the underlying risk — a file can be followed to the letter on a case it never really evaluated. And watching it mishandle a tracker update doesn't prove the skill is broken — it may just be a case the file's steps don't cover.",
